starting work with
  organization  audit  (given as --organization)
  project       audit-project  (given as --project)
  repository    https://github.com/octocat/Hello-World.git  (given as --repository)
  branch        master  (given as --branch)
  agent         audit-agent  (given as --agent)
  harness       opencode  (the harness audit-agent is declared on; --harness overrides it)
  model         none  (the model audit-agent is declared with; --model overrides it)
  credentials   none  (none is held, so a Session reaches a model only through a harness logged in otherwise; --credential overrides it)
